# Build-input attestation for the hyprbars title-bar plugin.
#
# rebuild-hyprbars checks every line here against every file in the hyprbars
# source directory. `pre` digests are the upstream tree as it arrives at the
# pinned commit, checked before anything local touches it; `post` digests are
# the same tree once Mullion's four patches have been applied, checked
# immediately before the compiler runs.
#
# Every entry in the directory is attested, the Makefile that `make` executes
# included. A missing file, an added file, a link, a subdirectory or a single
# changed byte stops the build.
#
# Together with the pinned commit this makes the build reproducible from
# published inputs: the commit fixes what is fetched, the `pre` digests prove
# the fetch is what was reviewed, the patches are deterministic text
# substitutions, and the `post` digests prove the exact bytes compiled on this
# machine are the bytes reviewed for this release.
#
# Regenerate a section with: ./patches/verify-pins regenerate <commit>
#
# Sections are keyed by the hyprland-plugins commit, so a future Hyprland
# release adds a section rather than editing one.

